RULES=[
('R1',('Transfer changes with context','迁移随情境改变'),('Shared updating versus context-dependent expression','共享更新与情境依赖表达'),('Cross training and test cues; read the first probe before new error.','交叉训练与测试线索；在新误差出现前读取首次探针。'),('Test-cue effects identify expression; training effects persisting under a common test cue motivate updating/retention comparisons.','测试线索效应识别表达；共同测试线索下保留的训练效应推动更新/保持比较。'),('Match sensory information and cue credibility; include cue-only no-error controls.','匹配感觉信息与线索可信度；加入纯线索无误差对照。'),'E02–E04, E19','Input, gain and retention factors can reproduce the same product; family recovery remains low.','输入、增益与保持可产生相同乘积；家族恢复率仍低。'),
('R2',('Learning changes with sensory reliability or source','学习随感觉可靠性或来源改变'),('Input remapping versus update routing','输入重映射与更新路由'),('Calibrate perceived visual/proprioceptive displacement; estimate two independent error directions with paired outputs.','校准感知视觉/本体位移；使用两个独立误差方向和配对输出。'),('An effect explained by calibrated input supports an input account; a remaining matrix interaction motivates downstream models.','被校准输入解释的效应支持输入解释；剩余矩阵交互推动下游模型比较。'),('Validate calibration in the target task; propagate its uncertainty into model predictions.','在目标任务验证校准，并将其不确定性传播至模型预测。'),'E14–E18','Input mixing produced 18.7–20.2% positive routing decisions; independent correction reduced this to 2.2–2.5% in the tested simulation.','所测模拟中，输入混合产生18.7–20.2%路由阳性判断；独立修正后降至2.2–2.5%。'),
('R3',('Correction and next-trial learning covary','纠错与下一试次学习共变'),('Fixed temporal copying versus integrated teaching signal','固定时间复制与整合教学信号'),('Add two error-onset times and a late sign reversal; record full correction, holding and next-trial waveforms.','增加两个误差起始时点及晚期反转；记录完整纠错、保持与下一试次波形。'),('Timing displacement supports copying; preserved learning timing with tonic-amplitude prediction supports integration.','时间位移支持复制；学习时间保持而持续幅度可预测学习，支持整合。'),('Fit on one timing and predict the other; match perceived error and observation noise.','在一个时序拟合并预测另一个；匹配感知误差与观测噪声。'),'E06–E07, E18','The reduced matrix simulations omit temporal waveform mechanisms; this contrast needs a separate time-resolved recovery study.','简化矩阵模拟未包含时间波形机制；该对比需要独立的时序模型恢复研究。'),
('R4',('Similar paths accompany different forces','相似轨迹伴随不同力'),('Neural gain versus impedance','神经增益与阻抗'),('Add background EMG and multidirectional small mechanical perturbations, resolved by latency.','增加背景肌电及小幅多方向机械扰动，并按潜伏期分解。'),('A stiffness change explains a mechanical contribution; residual response structure at matched mechanics constrains neural control.','刚度变化解释力学贡献；匹配力学后的残余响应结构约束神经控制。'),('Match speed and posture; separate intrinsic mechanics from delayed feedback.','匹配速度与姿势；分离内在力学与延迟反馈。'),'E08–E10','The archived routing model has no explicit musculoskeletal impedance state; it cannot validate this rule quantitatively.','存档路由模型没有显式肌骨阻抗状态，无法定量验证该规则。'),
('R5',('A dissociation varies with delay','分离随延迟变化'),('Different acquisition versus different retention or probe-induced learning','获得差异与保持或探针诱发学习差异'),('Use independent first probes at multiple delays; counterbalance visual feedback during channels.','在多个延迟使用独立首次探针；平衡通道中的视觉反馈。'),('An early difference supports acquisition/readout effects; a later divergence directs attention to retention and probe exposure.','早期差异支持获得/读出效应；晚期分歧指向保持与探针暴露。'),('Avoid repeated probes as an unmodelled training block; include sensory-matched retention controls.','避免将重复探针作为未建模训练块；加入感觉匹配保持对照。'),'E04, E11, E20','Retention calibration is assumed in the simulation and must transfer to the target context.','模拟假设保持校准有效；其向目标情境的迁移需验证。'),
('R6',('Distinct sensory learning and cross-output transfer coexist','感觉特异学习与跨输出迁移并存'),('Sensory-specific states versus control-specific learners','感觉特异状态与控制特异学习器'),('Cross visual/proprioceptive errors with anticipatory and standardized feedback outputs; include opposite-sign errors.','交叉视觉/本体误差与预期、标准反馈输出；加入反符号误差。'),('Different input columns with transfer into both outputs support sensory specificity with shared access; selective outputs motivate output-specific factors.','输入列不同且均迁移至两个输出，支持感觉特异及共享利用；选择性输出推动输出特异因子解释。'),('Normalize readouts using independent gain estimates and match test context.','用独立增益估计归一化读出，并匹配测试情境。'),'E01–E03, E17–E18','Rank-one maps can arise from shared or synchronized separate states; rank alone cannot select storage architecture.','秩一映射可由共享或同步分别状态产生；仅凭秩无法选择存储架构。'),
('R7',('A shared model predicts held-out data better','共享模型的留出预测更优'),('Mechanistic sharing versus statistical stabilization','机制共享与统计稳定化'),('Match effective regularization, optimize all competitors and evaluate recovery across realistic and near-equivalent instances.','匹配有效正则化，充分优化所有竞争模型，跨真实噪声与近等价实例评估恢复。'),('Prediction advantage establishes predictive utility; mechanism selection additionally requires distinguishable intervention predictions and reliable recovery.','预测优势确立预测效用；机制选择还需要可区分干预预测及可靠恢复。'),('Preserve nested shared subsets within separate models; use full learning trajectories and complete held-out conditions.','保留分别模型中的嵌套共享子集；使用完整学习轨迹与完整留出条件。'),'E21; computational archive','Five-family recovery was 19.4% in the near-equivalent setting, with 20% balanced-label chance; report compatible families.','近等价条件五家族恢复率19.4%，平衡标签机会值20%；应报告兼容家族。')
]
RULES.append(('R8',('Task error changes apparent implicit learning','任务误差改变表观隐式学习'),('Task-error interaction versus strategic addition and attentional modulation','任务误差交互与策略叠加、注意调节'),('Cross task error with fixed cursor error, target flicker and instruction; collect matched aim reports plus immediate no-feedback aftereffects.','交叉任务误差、固定光标误差、目标闪烁及指示，采集匹配瞄准报告与即时无反馈后效。'),('A residual task-error slope after aim and attention controls supports interaction; instruction-sensitive improvement with stable implicit aftereffects supports strategic addition.','控制瞄准与注意后的残余任务误差斜率支持交互；改善对指示敏感而隐式后效稳定，支持策略叠加。'),('Match target-event timing, reporting demand, reaction time and feedback availability; model the measured attention component.','匹配目标事件时序、报告要求、反应时间与反馈可用性，建模所测注意成分。'),'E22–E23, E27','The matrix benchmark does not implement explicit strategy or attention; this rule is evidence-derived and requires temporal/strategic model recovery.','矩阵基准未实现显式策略或注意；该规则由证据导出，需要时序/策略模型恢复。'))

RULES[1]=('R2',('Learning changes with sensory reliability or source','学习随感觉可靠性或来源改变'),('Input changes versus updating with mixed report loadings','输入变化与混合报告载荷下的更新'),('Add active/passive reports and independent loading calibration; test report predictions in a new context.','增加主动/被动报告及独立载荷校准，在新情境检验报告预测。'),('Separated predictions support factor contrasts; unknown or collinear loadings retain a continuum of decompositions.','预测分离支持因子对比；未知或共线载荷保留连续等价分解。'),('Match kinematics and sensory exposure; measure passive-exposure aftereffects and report transport.','匹配运动学与感觉暴露；测量被动暴露后效及报告迁移。'),'E12, E15, E17, E24–E26','Exact aliases survive precise reports when update cross-loading is ignored; the new stress test varies this loading.','忽略更新交叉载荷时，精确报告仍可产生精确混淆；新压力测试改变该载荷。')
RULES[5]=('R6',('Output ratios vary with delay','输出比例随延迟变化'),('Common temporal modes with mixed readout versus output-specific modes','混合读出的共同时间模式与输出特异模式'),('Measure both outputs over multiple independent delays and reserve new delays or histories.','在多个独立延迟测量两个输出，并留出新延迟或历史。'),('A changing ratio rejects an effectively one-mode trajectory; common recurrences test shared temporal dynamics.','比例变化排除有效单模式轨迹；共同递推检验共同时间动力学。'),('Control probe-driven updating, exposure, baseline gains and near-zero responses.','控制探针诱发更新、暴露、基线增益及接近零的响应。'),'E01–E03, E17, E28','Fixed mixed readout generates changing ratios; duplicated separate states reproduce common-mode predictions exactly.','固定混合读出产生变化比例；复制的分别状态精确复现共同模式预测。')
RULES[6]=tuple(list(RULES[6][:7])+['New cross-study tests compare 3/4/6/8-parameter temporal families with source-only ridge selection and paired residual recovery.','新增跨研究检验比较3/4/6/8参数时间家族，采用来源内正则选择及配对残差恢复。'])
